abstract: >-
  IEPP is an entropy-anchored research protocol, conceived and developed by
  Woocheol Seo, for testing whether an AI agent or other enrolled digital
  entity presents the next accepted continuation of a canonical execution
  lineage.
keywords:
  - AI agent identity
  - AI agent continuity
  - execution continuity
  - digital entity identity
  - canonical lineage
  - intrinsic entropy
  - challenge-response
